{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SHEG1rigdeJRiSL8iuzgM6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, **the companion metadata change proposal (KIP-1181) was merged into the main proposal (KIP-1163)** rather than kept as independent.\\\\n\\\\nAccording to the documentation, Ivan Yurchenko (from the Diskless Topics team) responded to a question about whether KIP-1181 and KIP-1164 were up to date by stating:\\\\n\\\\n> \\\\\\\"We have deprecated KIP-1181 as it's now incorporated into KIP-1163.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis indicates that the metadata change that was originally planned as a separate KIP-1181 companion proposal to KIP-1150 (Diskless Topics design) was consolidated into KIP-1163, which contains the detailed design for Diskless Topics.\\\\n\\\\n**Sources:**\\\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1150/2026-01-21-mail-e58f66bce66effcea001668d-42dc27fa.md` (lines 129-139)\\\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1150/2026-01-19-mail-db5cb0e7.md` (lines 41-45)\\\\n- `/store/kips/KIP-1150/2026-01-22-mail-discuss-diskless-topics-22e58073.md` (lines 164-172)\\\\n- And multiple other related mailing list threads with consistent information\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"kips/KIP-1150/2026-01-21-mail-e58f66bce66effcea001668d-42dc27fa.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":29.56,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":148369,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":37691,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.10092789999999999,\\\"input_tokens\\\":74,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2127}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88c2bb66-ceda-4b5a-9aca-33458b1d1334","uuid":"7fdf14d0-418f-4a22-9fe6-d94d35b86261","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:44:15.604Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, **the companion metadata change proposal (KIP-1181) was merged into the main proposal (KIP-1163)** rather than kept as independent.\\\\n\\\\nAccording to the